    <label for="method-token">Simulated card outcome</label>
    <select id="method-token" name="method_token">
        <option value="demo_success">Successful payment</option>
        <option value="demo_failure">Declined payment</option>
    </select>
    <p class="small text-body-secondary">For card testing only. No money is charged. This option does not apply to EFT.</p>
</div>
<p>For EFT, find the bank account details and your unique payment reference on your order after placing it.</p>
